  "strengths": [
    "Richest open-source spatial SQL function library",
    "Spatial and relational data join in one transactional database",
    "GiST/SP-GiST/BRIN spatial indexing for fast proximity queries",
    "Universal support across managed Postgres providers and GIS tools (QGIS, GeoServer)"
  ],
  "weaknesses": [
